1919+ 78CB                  ; Punto 2: Top-Right (X + 7, Y)
1920+ 78CB 79               ld   a, c
1921+ 78CC C6 07            add  a, 7
1922+ 78CE 4F               ld   c, a
1923+ 78CF CD 98 78         call CheckNastyCell
1924+ 78D2 38 2F            jr   c, .collision
